  - "weak lensing"
  - "gravitational slip"
abstract: >
  SHA-256 sealed predictions for Euclid DR1 generated by a custom
  efc_logistic gravity model in the hi_class Boltzmann solver.
  Benchmark (B0=0.02, M0=0.06): sigma8 +1.21%, P(k) +2.09%,
  lensing -6.01%, E_G -3.98%. Planck ISW constrains M0 < 0.1.
  Stability requires M0 >= 3*B0.
